  "texts": {
    "preamble": "M Mallesh vs The State Of Ap on 1 September, 2020 Author: D.Ramesh Bench: D.Ramesh The Hon'Ble Sri Justice D.Ramesh Criminal Petition No.3532 of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "This is a Criminal Petition filed under section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973, to release the auto bearing No.AP 37 TC 8359 and the products seized from the said auto in connection with Crime No.159 of 2020 on the file of Denduluru Police Station, West Godavari District. The offences alleged are under Sections 270, 273, 328 read with 34 of the Indian Penal Code, 1860 and Sections 58 and 59 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": "If any crime, as apprehended by the Public prosecutor, takes place, it is for the concerned to take action, as permitted by law.\" 4.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
